 "Click \"Summarize old turns\" to play with the numbers.": "",
 "Every turn re-sends the whole history, so the context <0>fills up</0> as tool results and messages accumulate.": "",
 "Compaction replaces old turns with a short <0>summary</0> and keeps recent turns verbatim, freeing room to keep working.": "",
 "Compaction is lossy: details not in the summary are gone unless they were saved to external memory first.": "",
 "Triggers are usually a fraction of the window (e.g. ~{#}%); the exact policy varies by product.": "",
 "Alternatives: truncate oldest turns, drop bulky old tool results, or offload to files and re-read on demand.": "",
