 "▼ Dive in: <0>Stage by stage</0>": "",
 "RAG = <0>R</0>etrieval-<1>A</1>ugmented <2>G</2>eneration: look up relevant text first, paste it into the prompt, then let the model answer.": "",
 "Documents are <0>chunked</0>, each chunk is <1>embedded</1> into a vector, and vectors go into an index. A query is embedded the same way and compared by cosine similarity.": "",
 "The model never \"queries the database\": it only sees the retrieved text as ordinary tokens in the prompt.": "",
 "Indexing happens ahead of time (offline); only the query embedding and the top-k search happen at question time.": "",
 "The query and the chunks must use the <0>same</0> embedding model, or the vectors are not comparable.": "",
 "Chunk size and overlap are tuning knobs; there is no universally best value.": "",
